      "content": "Let a<sub>1</sub>, a<sub>2</sub>, a<sub>3</sub>, .... be a sequence of positive integers in arithmetic progression with common difference 2. Also, let b<sub>1</sub>, b<sub>2</sub>, b<sub>3</sub>, .... be a sequence of positive integers in geometric progression with common ratio 2. If a<sub>1</sub> = b<sub>1</sub> = c, then the number of all possible values of c, for which the equality 2(a<sub>1</sub> + a<sub>2</sub> + ... + a<sub>n</sub>) = b<sub>1</sub> + b<sub>2</sub> + ... + b<sub>n</sub> holds for some positive integer n, is ...........",
